@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
title Behavior - Mark a story Done from the edit form
actor "Authorized user" as actor
box "Frontend - Mission Control application" #E0F2FE
  participant "WorkItemFormDialog / WorkItemForm" as page
  participant "UnfinishedTasksDialog" as dialog
  participant "IWorkItemService / WorkItemService" as client
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Api" #D1FADF
  participant "CurrentAccountAuthorization / WorkItemsController" as ctrl
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
  participant "UpdateWorkItemCommandHandler / StoryStatusTransition" as handler
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
  database "Mission Control SQL" as db
end box
actor -> page : Set Status to Done in the edit form and save
page -> client : update(UpdateWorkItemCommand: status Done, the other edits, expected version, no condition)
client -> ctrl : PUT /api/workspaces/{id}/work-items/{itemId}; authentication and validation as in the edit sequence
ctrl -> handler : Handle UpdateWorkItemCommand through MediatR 12.5.0
handler -> db : BeginWorkspaceTransactionAsync takes the workspace lock first; LoadStoryPlacementsAsync reads the story, its live placements, and its completion condition
db --> handler : Story HCK-112 with 3 unfinished tasks
handler -> handler : L2-021 StoryCompletionPolicy: the sent condition is absent or not current
handler --> ctrl : 409 unfinished-tasks with the count and StoryCompletionCondition; nothing changed
ctrl --> client : ProblemDetails (unfinished-tasks)
client --> page : The promise rejects with the condition; WorkItemForm keeps every edit
page -> page : completionStatus ConfirmationRequired (story key, title, saved status, condition)
page -> dialog : WorkItemFormDialog sets prompt Asking and opens it; focus Keep in progress
alt Keep in progress
  dialog --> page : kept
  page -> page : completionDecision Keep (Keep in progress or Escape): the form restores the saved status in the draft and sends nothing; completionStatus Settled closes the confirmation
  page --> actor : The edit form stays open with the other edits; focus returns to Status
else Mark story Done
  dialog --> page : confirmed(condition)
  page -> page : completionDecision carries the condition; completionStatus Saving: the prompt shows progress (saving state)
  page -> client : Resubmit the same UpdateWorkItemCommand with the returned condition
  client -> ctrl : PUT /api/workspaces/{id}/work-items/{itemId}
  ctrl -> handler : Handle
  handler -> db : Lock first; LoadStoryPlacementsAsync; check version and condition before any write
  db --> handler : Current story and condition, or lock-wait timeout
  alt Condition and version current
    handler -> db : StoryStatusTransition sets Done, moves every live placement to Done, and increments the active sprint's version when the story is a member; AddAuditEvent; SaveChangesAsync in one transaction
    db --> handler : New story version
    handler --> ctrl : Updated item
    ctrl --> client : 200 with the new version
    client --> page : completionStatus Settled closes the confirmation; WorkItemForm emits saved with a WorkItemSavedResult; the edit dialog closes with Saved(saved, title, parentTitle)
    page --> actor : The opening page increments its refresh counter, so its view rereads, and shows the "Changes saved" toast
  else Task count changed since the prompt (L2-021)
    handler --> ctrl : 409 unfinished-tasks with the new count and condition; nothing changed
    ctrl --> client : ProblemDetails (unfinished-tasks)
    client --> page : completionStatus ConfirmationRequired with the new condition; the open dialog shows the server's count (server-count state) and asks again
  else Story changed after the form opened (stale version, L2-041)
    handler --> ctrl : 409 stale version; nothing changed
    ctrl --> client : ProblemDetails (changed)
    client --> page : completionStatus Settled closes the confirmation; WorkItemForm keeps the attempted values, calls reload() on its item resource once, and shows the comparison (conflict state); nothing is resent
  else Commit fails (500), or the workspace lock wait times out (503 with Retry-After)
    handler --> ctrl : 500 with correlation ID, or 503; nothing changed
    ctrl --> client : ProblemDetails
    client --> page : completionStatus Failed(referenceId): the confirmation stays open with the reference ID (failed state); Mark story Done resends the same request only when chosen; Keep in progress restores the saved status
  else Story deleted meanwhile
    handler --> ctrl : 404; nothing changed
    ctrl --> client : ProblemDetails (not found)
    client --> page : completionStatus Settled closes the confirmation; the form shows edit-not-found, whose Back to work emits notFound; the edit dialog closes with NotFound; the page calls the layout's refresh(), and the detail page opens the work outline
  else No response to the resubmission (timeout or network failure)
    client --> page : The update may have committed: WorkItemForm keeps the attempted values and calls reload() on its item resource once; completionStatus Settled closes the confirmation and focus returns to Status
    page --> actor : The form announces the persisted status (for example "HCK-112 is In Progress") with the failed alert "We couldn't confirm whether your changes were saved", without a reference ID, and emits unconfirmed so the page rereads its view; nothing is resent
  end
end
note over ctrl, db
A 401 at either request ends the session once (sessionInterceptor, end(Unauthorized)); the edit was not saved, so sign-in shows session-unsaved.
Updating work needs only an active session, so a 403 is unexpected: it changes nothing, completionStatus Forbidden restores the saved status in the draft,
WorkItemFormDialog closes the confirmation and emits forbidden, and the opening page shows the "Your access changed" toast without Retry; the edit form stays open.
Mutations are never retried automatically.
Unexpected failures return generic 500 plus correlation ID (L2-043).
end note
@enduml
